v 3
d helprun -- Run a complete Stata help example by clicking it in the Viewer
d
d helprun turns the examples in any Stata help file into clickable controls.
d Open a help topic, type helprun, then click "Run this example" beside the
d example you want. The help file is never modified and the example runs in a
d hidden Stata, so your data and results are untouched. Each run is saved in a
d directory named for the help topic beneath your working directory.
d
d Requires Windows and Stata's Python integration.
d
d test_helprun.do ships as an ancillary member: retrieve it with
d net get helprun. It reproduces the validation suite against the
d exact copy you installed, needs the tests and fixtures from the
d GitHub release, and refuses with a clear message without them.
d
